Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:13.01,Title,0,0,0,0,,《上海正午2》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:35.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1887年 中国紫禁城）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经跟你说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚收到哥哥的来信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在美国挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.07,0:03:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问候你 爹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经没有哥哥了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boxers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再往前走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one step further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉玺的看护人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The keeper of the Imperial Seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the man I was looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中国人进步很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Chinese are very progressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是老朋友给你的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift from an old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.78,0:05:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌超\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wu Chow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我问候你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted me to send his regards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉玺 你必须要夺回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seal. You must get it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个给你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give this….to your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you reading?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.26,0:07:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 「罗伊·欧班纳对决木乃伊」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh."Roy O'Bannon vs. The Mummy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.33,0:07:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊打败了整个木乃伊军队和…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy's just taken out the Mummy's entire army{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇神联盟的士兵 而他只有一颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}of zombie confederate soldiers, and he only had one bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:07:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊想出了利用峡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy figured out the physics of the canyon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让子弹在峡谷壁上反弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then ricocheted a bullet off the canyon wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,打中了每个蛇神士兵的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nailed each zombie through the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个上海小子怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the Shanghai Kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在第10页中被抓\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was captured and knocked out on page 10{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.69,0:08:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他擦罗伊枪柄上珍珠的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}while he was polishing Roy's pearl handles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊将把他从死亡中救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy's about to save him from becoming a human sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些故事都是骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those stories are all lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 看这\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,背面这写了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says right here on the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,作者塞奇·麦考利斯特 他所有故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Author Sage McCallister bases all his stories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是基于第一手资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}on firsthand accounts."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 警官 没有公主的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sheriff. No princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:08:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天中午你都等她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day you meet the noon stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day it's the same story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩佩已经嫁到三番了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pei Pei's married to her work in San Francisco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.51,0:09:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,时髦女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Modern woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官 你有包裹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, you got a parcel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.65,0:09:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 说不定是她寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, maybe it's from her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是我妹妹从中国寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's from my sister in China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我必须要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这给新长官做匹好马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here and be a good horsey for the new sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 那辆马车朝东\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sheriff, that stage is headed east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国不是在这西边吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't China kind of west of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不回中国 我要去纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to China. I'm going to New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊用我的钱做了投资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy invested my money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真住在里兹大饭店顶上的阁楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true that he lives in a penthouse at the top of the Ritz{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,无数美女围着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounded by dozens of beautiful women{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他呼来唤去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}at his every beck and call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时以前的罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the old Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经结婚了 都安定下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's married, settled down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.71,0:10:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 他已经变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, he's changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候他们人比我们多\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there we were. Completely outnumbered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没告诉我们没机会嬴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't have to tell me we didn't stand a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把那个上海小子和公主送到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I send the Shanghai Kid and the princess out the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的上海小子 他被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Shanghai Kid. He was so frightened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了他 可他却没有谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He forgot to thank me for saving his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm used to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着 我来到前面 我数到3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I returned to the front, and I counted to three….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.73,0:11:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后冲了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I burst out of the mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪柄上的珍珠在闪烁着 子弹乱飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pearl handles blazing. Lead flying everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可没一颗打中我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not a single bullet touched me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议 呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝的金子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the emperor's gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把它分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we divided it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚持要把我的那份分给那些印第安人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I insisted on giving my share to the Indians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些野人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The savages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要再叫那些高尚的人为野人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't ever call those noble people savages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你对自己的身体引以为豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If being proud of your body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天光着身子等着车接送会让你变成野人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wanting to ride around naked all day makes you a savage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 你在和一个野人喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, by God, you're drinking with a savage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你怎么叫法国吐司\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is what you call a French toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:12:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真狡猾 欧班纳斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so sophisticated, Mr. O'Bannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁去拿点香宾？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's up for some more bubbly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach for the sky, Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach for the sky, Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon Wang!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个狡猾的小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sly son of a gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你 瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you! Look at you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么来纽约了 我的那份黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brings you to New York? My share of the gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想想 什么黄金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refresh my memory. What gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝的金子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor's gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好把 现在 那些金子在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, that gold is in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔街做长线投资\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the Wall Street pros call a longterm investment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能用它 因为它还在赚钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't touch it because it's building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need it tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚到 让我们来庆祝一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got here. Let's celebrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚到大城市来 我爸爸被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got to the big city. My father's been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:12:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, I'm….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要钱回去办葬礼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need the money to get back for the funeral?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要去英国 船今晚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I must go to England. The ship leaves tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸死在英国了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father died in England?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国 我妹妹跟踪凶手到了伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}China. My sister followed the murderer to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 凶手 我有点懵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Murderer. I'm a little bit mixed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.39,0:13:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你是否能直截了当告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see if I can get the facts straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有个妹妹？你从没告诉我你有个妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a sister? You never told me you had a sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她长得漂亮吗 还是像你？诚实点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she pretty or does she look like you? Be honest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 我要我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, I need my money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你说话的语气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like that tone of voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我偷了你的钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think after all we've been through I'd stiff you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很了解我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing pretty well for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.77,0:13:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 罗伊 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Roy. That's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在日子不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going through a really tough time right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得学着相信别人 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be more trusting of people, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 我是罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. It's Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,5号桌的那对已经可以点菜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The couple at table 5 is ready to order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.62,0:13:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you work here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不在这工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't work here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来这些家伙穿的衣服跟我很象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like these guys are wearing a similar jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 这是你的小费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, here's your cut of the tips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最傻的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the craziest thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是因为我总来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess because I come in here so much{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们错认为我是这的服务生\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're mistaking me for a waiter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.24,0:14:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人尴尬 你把金子输了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's embarrassing. You lost the gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有的　　　其余的在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of it. Where's the rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有句话要告诉你：飞艇股票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one word for you. Zeppelin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要我的钱 就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my money now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意为这些钱做任何事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you do anything for this money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我今晚必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I must leave tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 拿着这钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Take this key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,到房间 洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the room. Get cleaned up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老友罗伊有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old pal Roy's got a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 大男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, big boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.03,0:15:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有个女人 她想让我跟她睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a woman in there! She wants me to sleep with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她当然想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course she does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她中国出名的不仅仅是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her the Great Wall ain't the only big thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,长城\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming out of China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要那么说？因为你能拿到钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you say that? So you could get the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会为了钱和那个女人睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not sleep with women for money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为了钱和她睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna sleep with her for money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 回去做你该做的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, just go in there and do your business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你在英国的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and think about your sister in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,职责所在 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duty calls. Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 市长先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mr. Mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,10楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}10th floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊？罗伊 你有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy? Roy, you got trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去查点事 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to check on something. I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 新计划 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, new plan. We got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:15:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, what are you doing?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在给她治背\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fixing her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她放下 你个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her down, you decadent Philistine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.23,0:16:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 姜 快点 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chon, come on! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜 拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Byebye. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time to explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道的是有坏人在跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to know is there are bad men after us….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm in the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 你要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy. You gotta trust me on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我生命中的变迁时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a transitional phase in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 但是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…. But what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道真相？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有点失落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little lost right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你 你有志向\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you. You've got a sense of purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是看看我 我是个30岁的侍应生、男妓\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look at me. I'm a 30yearold waiter/gigolo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么将来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the future in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.21,0:16:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那计划是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直是我的榜样 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always my compass, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划 你问我正确的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan. You ask me the right questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.61,0:16:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:17:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划 我想是找个合适的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan, I think, is to find the right woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,生好多孩子然后教他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise a lot of children and teach them values.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 罗伊 离开这的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Roy. The plan to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 计划 有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, the plan. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察 警察 他们可以帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops! Cops! They can help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 姜 不是这些警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Chon, not these cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是坏警察 他们向人们要好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are dirty cops. They take advantage of people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 如果他们拦下我们 记着 我不是罗伊欧班纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if they stop us, remember, I'm not Roy O'Bannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你朋友 从西部来的亡命之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your friend Smoky Desperado from the West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who am l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你是班尼哈那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. You're Benihana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,班尼哈那　　　对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benihana. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这城市里教残疾儿童逾迦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You teach crippled children yoga here in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先走　　　不 为什么是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go first. No! Why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你掺合进来了 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you blend in, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.33,0:17:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 走 不要跟他们说再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go! Don't let them see you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,班尼哈那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benihana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psst! Chon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 别浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Stop wasting time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 我找到离开这的票了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, I found our ticket out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们起程了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来想老的罗伊又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like old Roy came through again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.47,0:19:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就象以前 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like old times, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,查查这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check over there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条巷子 那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over to the alley! That way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就象以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just like old times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能暂时不想金子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you forget about the gold for a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会有比你做梦还要多的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have more money than you ever dreamed of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.19,0:19:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当把飞艇股票卖掉的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when that first zeppelin takes off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我总是相信你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I always believe you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.19,0:19:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该庆幸我没把钱投到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky I didn't invest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,荒谬的汽车股票\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that ridiculous automobile idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.73,0:20:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那会赚很多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's gonna make a lot of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗窝 我在狗窝里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doghouse. I'm in the doghouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 快点 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我说了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry I lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想让你失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't want to disappoint you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我想要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忍受不了你那表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take that look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.01,0:20:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从我爸爸那学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned it from my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.74,0:20:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他过去就这么看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he used to look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸是干什么的？他是宫廷侍卫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did your dad do? Was he an lmperial Guard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much more important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.89,0:21:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是玉玺的看护人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the keeper of the lmperial Seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我喜欢中国的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I love about China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人的工作听起来都很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's job description sounds so damn cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从成吉思汗以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seal has been symbol of the emperor's power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉玺象征皇帝的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}since Genghis Khan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一代代传下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been passed down from one emperor to another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家族已经保管了12代了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family have been watching over it for 12 generations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,12代？\N{\fnArial\fs30}12 generations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和爸爸曾经一起讨论国家大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father and I used to skip stones across the moat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,说有天我会继承他的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}and talk about a day I would follow his footsteps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他唯一的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was his only son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果当时我在 我就可以保护他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'd have been there, I could have protected him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的错 你在3000英里以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault. You were 3, 000 miles away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.10,0:21:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小盒子是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with that little box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹寄给我的 爸爸转交给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister sent it to me from my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.74,0:21:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有个消息 说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a message inside. What's it say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个难题箱 我不知道怎么他开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a puzzle box. I don't know how to open yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.34,0:21:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿个锤子砸烂它 你就可以知道里面说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a hammer and smash it open so you can see what it says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要有耐性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我可以打开它的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I'm able to open it….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就可以看那个消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be ready to read the message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 顽固\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Confucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.42,0:22:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我所听过的事中最土的一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the corniest thing I've ever heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.72,0:22:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go to England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.20,0:22:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到杀你爸爸的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find your dad's killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把玉玺夺回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get that seal back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有任何奖励的 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reward for this, Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过要奖励了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said anything about a reward?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.17,0:22:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说友谊 忠诚 荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about friendship, loyalty, honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.74,0:22:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说英国是个温柔乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hear England is ass soup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of pretty girls there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.97,0:22:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个有请…\N{\fnArial\fs30}First order of business, my Lords….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一份报告 我们尊敬的朋友雷斯本大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a report from our esteemed friend Lord Rathbone….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.61,0:23:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最近刚从中国的… 一个外交任务中回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}who recently returned from a diplomatic mission to China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.39,0:23:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位同僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellow Lords….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.52,0:23:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕从东方带回来一个… 令人困扰的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I bring disturbing news from the Orient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸦片战争已经蹂躏了大地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The opium wars have ravaged the land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.30,0:23:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝的敌人也已经组织起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor's enemies are organizing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,最狠毒的就是刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most vicious are the Boxers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群无神论的叛乱者杀人不眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A godless band of rebels who murder without discretion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.91,0:23:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国已陷入困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}China is not well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.88,0:23:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带回来了一个特使 他将带给我们一些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have brought back an envoy who should give us some insight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.02,0:23:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对中国无法预测精神的洞察力\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the inscrutable mind of the Chinese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.12,0:23:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he mad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.56,0:23:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝给了维多利亚女皇最高权威\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given to Her Majesty Queen Victoria by the emperor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.56,0:23:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为她在位显赫的50年以做酬答\N{\fnArial\fs30}in recognition of her 50 glorious years on the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛮横的家伙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outrageousness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.24,0:24:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,女皇万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live the queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.29,0:24:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克和职业杀手再次对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}BOY: Jack the Ripper strikes again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.70,0:24:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,号外！号外！看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extra! Extra! Read all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.50,0:24:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.10,0:24:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国人不友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}The English are not very friendly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.30,0:24:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是痛恨失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just sore losers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.87,0:24:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们输了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they lose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.41,0:24:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件小事叫美国革命 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little thing called the American Revolution, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.91,0:24:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.95,0:24:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你些精彩的部份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you the highlights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.38,0:24:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去了大概100万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came over with about a million men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.35,0:24:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一群农民那着干草叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a bunch of farmers with pitchforks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.39,0:24:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,象打鼓似的把他们打败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and beat 'em like a drum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.92,0:24:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！我在这走着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I'm walking here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.83,0:25:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're driving on the wrong side of the road!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.26,0:25:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群业余的家伙 这些人根本不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of amateurs. These people don't get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.03,0:25:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.57,0:25:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.74,0:25:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？难道我不能看漂亮小姐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I'm not supposed to notice a pretty lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.08,0:25:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你想安顿下来 有个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you wanted to settle down and have a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.61,0:25:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么想 姜 我希望我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, Chon. I just hope I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.98,0:25:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.12,0:25:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I worry that all the damn horseback riding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.79,0:25:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在西部骑马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did out in the West, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.15,0:25:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个硬马鞍上跳上跳下可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}bouncing up and down on the hard saddles might have made it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.23,0:25:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,使我的三文鱼不再逆流而上 象它们应该的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}so my salmon don't swim upstream the way they're supposed to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.66,0:25:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.80,0:25:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我在对牛弹琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be shooting blanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.03,0:25:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.14,0:25:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.44,0:25:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.44,0:25:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人不想有个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people are not meant to have a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.08,0:25:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和孩子一直有个特殊的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always had such a special connection with children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.95,0:25:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些跟在你后面的小骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little ankle biters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.32,0:25:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看着点 小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, watch it, you little punk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me, guv.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.16,0:26:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们迷路了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gents lost your way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.16,0:26:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们在找我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're looking for my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.69,0:26:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她住在牛津街32号\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's staying at 32 Oxford Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.53,0:26:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对那很熟 我和一个老头曾经住那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it well, guv. Me old man used to live there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.77,0:26:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我们怎么去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you show us the way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.84,0:26:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,记不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, memory's a little dodgy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确定我能带你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sure for a bob I could get you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.41,0:26:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想从我们这得到什么？以为我们是乡巴佬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you take us for? Okies from Muskogee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.21,0:26:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,到别处去卖你那些废话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go sell your bullshit someplace else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.35,0:26:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not buying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.38,0:26:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的小费 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the tip, guv.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.12,0:26:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你偷了我叔叔的表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I stole that watch from my uncle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.45,0:26:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.11,0:27:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 你这个小乞丐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you little rubbish eater!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.35,0:27:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你偷我们的草皮… 有什么后果 查里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I tell you about poaching on our turf, Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.55,0:27:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我什么都没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on the straight and narrow. Honest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.63,0:27:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打你以后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I'm through beating you….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.56,0:27:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会希望你从没从仓库里跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna wish you never ran away from the workhouse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.57,0:27:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the boy alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.17,0:27:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的观光客 离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody tourists! Get your noses out of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.17,0:27:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以对那孩子做任何事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do whatever you want to the kid….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.04,0:27:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是我的表\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's my watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.81,0:27:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们人比你们多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's a load of us and only two of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.35,0:27:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So piss off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 伙计 你说错了一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, fellas. You've lost one war this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.55,0:27:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再犯同样的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make the same mistake twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.50,0:27:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 追他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! After him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.88,0:28:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那呢 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is! Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到他了 快 梯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got him now. Move in, lads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.91,0:28:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 孩子 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, boys, wait, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的梯子上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up the bloody ladder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.86,0:29:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.46,0:29:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Watch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.34,0:29:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.84,0:29:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.16,0:30:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.56,0:30:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.52,0:30:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.99,0:31:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.74,0:31:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.18,0:31:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.91,0:31:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.01,0:31:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我管那个叫宫爆鸡丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call that one my kung pao chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.78,0:32:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拦下了那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I clotheslined the sucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.75,0:32:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.05,0:32:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.60,0:32:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们应该配合我到院子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you gentlemen should accompany me back to the yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.97,0:32:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是院子 是监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a yard! It's a jail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.64,0:32:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.94,0:32:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.32,0:32:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Someone's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.68,0:32:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来处理 让我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me handle this. I'm gonna handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.82,0:32:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国人不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The English aren't like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.35,0:32:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有感情的 很容易发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't get all emotional. Touchyfeely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.62,0:32:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.79,0:32:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打 我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Park the kung fu. Let me do the talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.56,0:32:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 让我给你个拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Let me give you a hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.43,0:32:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟了舰队街那帮家伙两年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been after that Fleet Street gang for two years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.50,0:32:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩把他们全打到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you two come along and bring them down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.54,0:33:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个下午之间 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a single afternoon. Brilliant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.48,0:33:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 恩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, um….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.18,0:33:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那是我的表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's my watch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.58,0:33:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一个街市小孩送来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. A street urchin turned it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.35,0:33:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小鬼最好别把表弄花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little punk better not have scuffed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.48,0:33:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你的运气是拣的 你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope your luck picks up. What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.59,0:33:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从你的表推断出你被打了一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deduced from your watch that you'd hit a rough patch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.69,0:33:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has. How do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.42,0:33:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我研究的一种新调查技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an investigative technique I've developed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.06,0:33:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以从一个个体推断出内在细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can deduce intimate details about an individual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.40,0:33:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过一个精密的审查 他们的随身物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}through a close scrutiny of their personal effects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.97,0:33:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能说出别的什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else can you tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.57,0:33:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个表的主人是个赌鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The owner of this watch is a bad gambler{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.81,0:33:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个恶心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a lousy shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.31,0:33:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管他死里逃生好几次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although he's cheated death several times….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.08,0:33:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他花了他生命中大部份时间 徘徊在一个宁愿可悲的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}he spends most of his life wandering in a rather pathetic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.68,0:33:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,和无用的调查 为了某种目的和尊敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}and futile search for purpose and respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.39,0:33:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.82,0:33:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有放纵女人的倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a penchant for loose women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.23,0:33:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That's amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.79,0:33:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定那是个很流行的聚会骗术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's a very popular party trick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.86,0:33:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在生日会上骗孩子用的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}at birthdays for small children….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.76,0:34:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对成年人不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it doesn't quite play with adults.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.70,0:34:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to set the record straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.30,0:34:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊·欧班纳… 不会吸引那些放纵的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy O'Bannon is not attracted to loose women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.04,0:34:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些放纵的女人吸引我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loose women are attracted to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.84,0:34:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是罗伊·欧班纳？对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Roy O'Bannon? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.04,0:34:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个著名的西部民间英雄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The famous Western folk hero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.08,0:34:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说过我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.31,0:34:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I heard of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.71,0:34:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读过… 「罗伊·欧班纳对决木乃伊」5遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've only read "Roy O'Bannon vs. The Mummy" five times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.15,0:34:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人着魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.45,0:34:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你见见那个上海孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to meet the Shanghai Kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.25,0:34:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.36,0:34:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠实的中国伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The faithful Chinese sidekick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.02,0:34:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是伙伴 那些故事都是骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a sidekick. Those stories are all lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.63,0:34:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 不要那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, don't be bitter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能左右塞奇麦考利斯特写什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help what Sage McCallister writes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.17,0:34:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果需要帮忙 我随时效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's anything I can do, I'm at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.00,0:34:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找我妹妹 她住在这个地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for my sister. She's staying at this address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.04,0:34:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,能带我们去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you take us there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.04,0:34:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.04,0:34:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你们最好和我来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'd better come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.91,0:35:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.21,0:35:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.78,0:35:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意 我在外面等\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind, I'll just wait outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.69,0:35:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}lntroduce me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.72,0:35:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这是玲 我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. This is Lin, my baby sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.23,0:35:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊·欧班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy O'Bannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.73,0:35:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.97,0:35:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没告诉我你妹妹是这么一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never told me your sister was such a….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.60,0:35:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽的莲花\N{\fnArial\fs30}beautiful lotus blossom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.51,0:35:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd she say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.68,0:35:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.55,0:35:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要用你们母语谈论我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No talking about me in your native tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.65,0:36:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在监狱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you in jail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.12,0:36:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟踪杀爸爸的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed the man who murdered Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.02,0:36:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.32,0:36:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查到他住在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found out where he live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.93,0:36:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偷偷的进了他的屋子想杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I snuck inside his house and tried to kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.86,0:36:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,查杀爸爸的凶手是我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my duty to find Father's killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.96,0:36:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是我的 答应爸爸的那个是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is mine! I'm the one who promised Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.70,0:36:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我才是他儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm his only son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.14,0:36:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你为了美国抛弃了我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you abandoned us for America….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.57,0:36:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸说他没有儿子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father said he had no son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.31,0:36:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.71,0:36:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Time out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.61,0:36:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time out. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.31,0:36:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个侦探是我的拥护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The detective's a fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.91,0:36:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么不打名人牌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I play the celebrity card?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.85,0:36:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把她弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get her out that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.59,0:36:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.02,0:36:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我会救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I'll get you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.50,0:36:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.10,0:36:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我要给你我的幸运扑克牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I'm gonna give you my goodluck playing cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.20,0:36:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要理会那些裸体女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ignore the naked ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.27,0:36:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wang!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.14,0:36:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打开爸爸那个盒子了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you opened Father's box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.38,0:37:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.09,0:37:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他试图暗杀雷斯本大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tried to assassinate Lord Rathbone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.76,0:37:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他正在喝下午茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}whilst he was taking afternoon tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.23,0:37:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是排在第10位的君主…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's 10th in line to the throne….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.43,0:37:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,女皇最喜欢的表弟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Majesty's favorite cousin….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.43,0:37:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是英国最好的剑客\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the finest swordsman in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.50,0:37:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 新闻说今天有比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, of course, the press had a field day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.74,0:37:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事把杰克和职业杀手挤掉 当了头条\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story actually knocked Jack the Ripper off the front page.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.97,0:37:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲不是杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artie, Lin is not a killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.84,0:37:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是非常、非常、非常惹火…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just a really, really, really hot….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.75,0:37:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱惹麻烦的中国女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}confused Chinese girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.71,0:37:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概如果我同意签几个亲笔签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if I agreed to sign a few autographs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.05,0:37:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我的一些英国的拥护者聊聊天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and talk to some of my fans here in England….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.19,0:37:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞点慈善活动 那样我们能把她带出去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do some type of charity event, can we get her out that way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.79,0:37:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕那不是问题关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that's out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.79,0:37:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹会怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will happen to my sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.29,0:37:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要上法庭 可能会被关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll go to trial, probably be locked away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.10,0:37:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是刑事罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an institution for the criminally insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.97,0:37:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些小报已经管她叫「疯狂玲」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tabloids have already dubbed her "Loony Lin."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.74,0:37:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那很容易被人记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was rather catchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.51,0:38:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.66,0:38:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们被发现在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any notion what would happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.49,0:38:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we were to be seen together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.93,0:38:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你回来 我还没见到玉玺呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since your return, I have yet to lay eyes on the lmperial Seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.83,0:38:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天会在乡下别墅… 举办一个50年庆典舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hosting a jubilee ball at my country estate tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.17,0:38:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be at the stables at midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.14,0:38:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,依照请求 我尊贵的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}As requested, a token of my esteem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.08,0:38:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.26,0:38:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们之间将会有更多的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope there will be more trust between us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.36,0:38:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我是皇帝 你是新国王的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I'm emperor and you are the new king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.00,0:39:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 白金汉宫 看那 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Buckingham Palace. Look at that, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.07,0:39:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是女皇住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the queen lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.31,0:39:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.54,0:39:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是皇家卫兵 他有很重要的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a royal guard. He has a very important job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.38,0:39:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也象他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to be just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.68,0:39:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们一点都不象你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're nothing like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.38,0:39:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是旅游胜地\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a tourist attraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.05,0:39:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以冲他们做鬼脸 侮辱他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make faces at them, insult them….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.12,0:39:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们却不能动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they can't move a muscle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.45,0:39:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个 罗伊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Watch this. Roy….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.02,0:39:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.39,0:39:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 兄弟 你鞋带开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, your shoes are untied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.90,0:39:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我见过的最大的海狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the biggest damn beaver I have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.53,0:39:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 停下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.87,0:39:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,女皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.87,0:39:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 是女皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! The queen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.90,0:39:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在向我们挥手\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mooning us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.71,0:39:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他差点就信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He almost went for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.41,0:39:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我朋友刚从美国来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend and I just came over from America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.68,0:39:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能听说过 我们要侵略你们这个小国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have heard of it. We run your jerkwater country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.45,0:39:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 你能接受从殖民地来的挑战吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you gonna take that from a colonial?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.68,0:39:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.82,0:39:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌你是个该死的纸人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you are one hell of a damn poker player.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.99,0:39:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有痛苦的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hard feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.26,0:39:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.03,0:40:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.70,0:40:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不允许那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not allowed to do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.10,0:40:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该惹他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't have touched him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.23,0:40:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 你这小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scram, you little punk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.33,0:40:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在伦敦警察局有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got friends at Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.94,0:40:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想在你胸口捶一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you up in a heartbeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.44,0:40:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到你的表了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get your watch back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.01,0:40:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心我的表 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about my watch. Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.51,0:40:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是击到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a knockoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.74,0:40:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.24,0:40:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叔叔从林肯那偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My uncle stole this watch from President Lincoln.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.08,0:40:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个无价的传家宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a priceless family heirloom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.12,0:40:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是从典当商那买回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not according to the pawnbroker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.22,0:40:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not steal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.69,0:40:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不偷我就没有饭吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't steal, I don't eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.95,0:40:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁教你功夫的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who showed you how to do all that kicking and punching?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.06,0:40:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.96,0:40:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听过吗？父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever heard of those? They're parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.10,0:40:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有 因为你是个孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't 'cause you're a little orphan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.00,0:40:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 走开吧 你在影响我们的形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go on. You're cramping our style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.87,0:40:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这个国家真差劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this country blows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.14,0:40:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要个地方住下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a place to stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.88,0:40:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧 暖和暖和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in and warm your dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.88,0:40:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会惹很多麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get into a lot of trouble{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.79,0:41:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯进个这样的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}breaking into a place like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.62,0:41:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That being said, well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.66,0:41:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚吃了最后的巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just ate the last chocolate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.63,0:41:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.83,0:41:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好照顾好你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta look out for number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.93,0:41:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could really get used to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.64,0:41:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,过着乡绅的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living the life of a country gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.10,0:41:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能画些画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe doing a little painting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.07,0:41:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让玲和孩子们在花园里玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Lin play in the garden with the children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.94,0:41:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,维拉 查克和大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vera, Chuck, and Dave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.45,0:41:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是玲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Lin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.95,0:41:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲是我见过女人中最漂亮的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin's the most beautiful woman I've ever met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.65,0:41:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她将是欧班纳家的救世主\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna be the savior of the house of O'Bannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.92,0:41:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 看看这些线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, check out the threads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.79,0:41:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所缺少的就是… 一条忠实的猎犬蜷缩在我脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm missing is the loyal hound curled at my feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.76,0:41:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在浪费时间 我们必须找到雷斯本\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are wasting time. We must find Rathbone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.26,0:41:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I've been doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.63,0:41:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在这喝着昂贵的烈酒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sitting here drinking expensive hooch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.70,0:41:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.77,0:41:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working on a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.14,0:41:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 哦 别把白兰地溅出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Whoa. Don't slosh the brandy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.44,0:41:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把花弄乱了 滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt messes with the bouquet. Sod off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.88,0:41:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在试着教你一系列的技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to teach you a skill set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.98,0:41:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你离开街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help get you off the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.55,0:42:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒保赚很多钱 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartenders make big bucks. Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.61,0:42:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.38,0:42:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.19,0:42:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们找到玉玺…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we find the seal….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.42,0:42:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以证明雷斯本杀了你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can prove Rathbone killed your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.66,0:42:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是古老的万福玛利亚游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the old Hail Mary play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.40,0:42:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有个想法 我们在哪挖个地道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also have a version where we dig a tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.83,0:42:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.83,0:42:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的弹射器 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody catapult. Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.10,0:42:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要弹射器 谁问你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need a catapult! Who asked you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.41,0:42:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人说话小孩别插嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't interrupt grownups when they're talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.57,0:42:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳尔逊雷斯本大人请了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lord Nelson Rathbone requests the pleasure of your company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.54,0:42:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,去女皇即位\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the jubilee ball{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.71,0:42:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,50年庆典舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}in honor of Her Majesty's 50th year on the throne."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.58,0:42:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听其来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.08,0:42:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会戒备森严\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't address security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.12,0:42:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会让我和姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna let Chon and I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.85,0:42:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳着华尔兹进城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}waltz into the castle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.36,0:42:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所需要的就是化装\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need is a proper disguise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.59,0:42:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢好好化个妆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do like a good disguise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.59,0:43:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来象个傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look like a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.19,0:43:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你是个王公 那是印度皇室\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! You're a maharaja. That's lndian royalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.16,0:43:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是中国人　　　一样啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm Chinese. It's the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.43,0:43:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,晃晃你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob your head a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.60,0:43:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你看起来更象印度皇族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gives you more of a lndiaroyalty flavor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.40,0:43:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 成绩显著 成绩显著\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. Good show, good show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.44,0:43:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,成绩显著 成绩显著\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good show, good show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.70,0:43:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀 好呀 好呀 好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheerio, cheerio. Cheerio, cheerio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.31,0:43:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见到雷斯本时怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do when we see Rathbone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.11,0:43:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.11,0:43:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 行吗？不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, okay? No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.11,0:43:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要有礼貌 因为我们还没拿到玉玺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be civil, 'cause we don't have the seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.98,0:43:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没玉玺 没有玲 没有家族荣誉 知道了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No seal. No Lin. No family honor. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.95,0:43:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 好 我们看起来还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be cool. Okay, we look great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.42,0:43:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们享受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's enjoy this party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.99,0:43:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你来干什么？我也进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. What are you doing? I'm going inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.23,0:43:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方会闹鬼的　　　你是马夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place is haunted. You're the harness man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.96,0:43:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回到马车那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get back at the carriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.33,0:44:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等在外面以防万一 我们能快点逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wait in case we need to make a quick getaway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.60,0:44:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续 各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Man your post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.70,0:44:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能总是得到你想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't always get what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.34,0:44:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么总是对那个孩子那么差？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you so mean to that boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.84,0:44:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从那孩子身上… 找到好多自己的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see a lot of myself in that kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.58,0:44:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让我有反常行为 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of freaking me out. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.29,0:44:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你的名字 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name, please, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.03,0:44:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才可以替您通报\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can announce you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.67,0:44:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢洛克…豪穆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock….Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.21,0:44:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢洛克豪穆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.61,0:44:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,您代表哪个省？您的职位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which province do you represent, Your Highness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.58,0:44:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,内华达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.04,0:45:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我引见谢洛克·豪穆斯少将\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present Major General Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.08,0:45:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,和内华达王公殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and His Highness, the maharaja of Nevada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.16,0:45:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安安排的怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are the security arrangements?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.20,0:45:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 所有的事都很顺利 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, everything seems to be going swimmingly, my Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.43,0:45:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我可以说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I may say so….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.70,0:45:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚很荣幸保卫大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is an honor to guard Your Lordship tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.40,0:45:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表伦敦警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I speak for all of us at Scotland Yard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.91,0:45:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,向您说不管您离王位多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I say that no matter how far you are from the throne….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.94,0:45:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们心中您永远都是第一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll always be number one in our hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.45,0:46:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 计划是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here's the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.32,0:46:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找个小个的中国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get a little chow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.89,0:46:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们悄悄离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're gonna sneak out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.69,0:46:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始找玉玺　　　好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start looking for that seal. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.19,0:46:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,葡萄干布丁 先生？　　　什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spotted Dick, sir? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.39,0:46:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,葡萄干布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spotted Dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.50,0:46:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能相信这家伙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.80,0:46:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找东西吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to get something to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.97,0:46:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在问我是不是拍手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's asking me if I got the clap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他是给你提供食品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's offering you food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.91,0:46:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 葡萄干布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Spotted Dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.98,0:46:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 我想我不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. I think I'll pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是个喜欢甜品的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really a dessert man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.01,0:46:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我朋友想要点葡萄干布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps my friend might like some Spotted Dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.35,0:46:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想尝尝那些香肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might try one of these sausages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.35,0:46:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小个的熏肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little smoky Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.49,0:46:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm! This is good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.13,0:46:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这的吃的会很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the food here was supposed to suck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.30,0:46:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,羊杂肠是从苏格兰运来的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The haggis is fresh from Scotland, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.56,0:46:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用最好的羊膀胱做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's made from the finest sheeps' bladders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.77,0:46:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去喝点威士忌然后漱漱口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get some whiskey and wash my mouth out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.85,0:47:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该试试野猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try the quail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.95,0:47:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上我自己打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot them myself this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.79,0:47:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 大人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do, Your Lordship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.19,0:47:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.99,0:47:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对内华达州不是很了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not acquainted with the Nevada province.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.46,0:47:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从81年后就没再去过印度\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I haven't been to lndia since '81.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.13,0:47:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在东方度过了… 我生命中大部份时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent most of my time in the Orient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.64,0:47:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你刚从中国回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you've just returned from China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.31,0:47:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是见多识广 王公\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are wellinformed, maharaja.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.51,0:47:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直梦想中国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my dream that the Chinese people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.81,0:47:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,会以印度为榜样 而且有一天信奉不列颠的法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}will follow lndia's example and one day embrace British rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.21,0:47:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国应该感到很骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chinese are very proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.85,0:47:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把家族和荣誉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They place family and honor above all else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.39,0:47:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,放得比任何事物都高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure we can break them of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.99,0:47:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我要走开一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me, I have a matter to attend to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.50,0:47:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们再次见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we meet again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.10,0:48:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心 我为你感到骄傲 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience. I'm proud of you, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.07,0:48:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找到玉玺\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must find the seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.05,0:48:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.38,0:48:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, shh, shh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.72,0:48:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从桌子上拿起一个象龙的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just pulled a fancy dragon key out of his desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.36,0:48:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my father's!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.89,0:48:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须为爸爸的荣誉复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must avenge his honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.46,0:48:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 慢点 急脾气 慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, slow down, tiger. Slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.93,0:48:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把所有中国人都算在我头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit going all Chinese on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.30,0:48:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.47,0:48:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 记着你的难题箱 耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Remember your puzzle box. Patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.37,0:48:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 没窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there are no windows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.68,0:48:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是从门进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just came in through the only doorway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.78,0:48:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}That leaves one explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.51,0:48:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得在「罗伊·欧班纳对决木乃伊」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember in "Roy O'Bannon vs. The Mummy"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.35,0:48:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇神是怎样逃的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how the zombie king got away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.58,0:48:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我追他进了法老王的墓时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I chased him into the pharaoh's tomb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.48,0:48:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现在斯芬克斯后面有条密道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a secret passageway behind the sphinx.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.29,0:48:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近应该有个杆或者按钮之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a lever or a button over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.72,0:48:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把这些东西抬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me lift some stuff up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.67,0:49:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.74,0:49:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那幅画…　　　它在看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The painting. It's looking at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.18,0:49:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看　　　哦 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.51,0:49:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来象是在看着我们 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it's looking at me. That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.68,0:49:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是真眼睛 会动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, real eyes. Moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.92,0:49:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被骗了 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid got to you, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.35,0:49:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信 我们不是在鬼屋吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable! We're not in a haunted house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.69,0:49:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是艺术家运用的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a technique that an artist uses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.82,0:49:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「普遍存在的凝视」或者「追踪的眼睛」是技术术语\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ubiquitous gaze" or "pursuant eyes" is the technical term.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.89,0:49:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点不正常 明白了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unnerving, though. I'll give you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.00,0:49:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 现在 会动的眼睛 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy. Now, those eyes. Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.00,0:49:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎么说 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you say, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.58,0:49:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看你这有什么 雷斯本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what you got here, Rathbone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.75,0:49:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.32,0:49:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 姜？它们现在在动吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Chon? Are the statues moving now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.40,0:50:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.96,0:50:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmmmm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.26,0:50:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.80,0:50:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再冲我喊 我都不知道自己在想什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear myself think with you shouting at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.20,0:50:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.37,0:50:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜？姜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon? Chon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.84,0:50:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.18,0:50:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想像孩子那样再玩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to act like a child and play games….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.88,0:50:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就去找别人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}then find someone else….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.42,0:50:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我现在在认真处理这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I take this stuff seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.92,0:51:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这是工作 我有任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to work. I'm on a mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.59,0:51:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.36,0:51:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 姜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.63,0:51:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你这个中国小赖皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you little Chinese otter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.76,0:51:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来玩玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.37,0:51:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.81,0:51:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜？魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, demons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.83,0:51:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她将会为我战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna fight my battles for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.77,0:51:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.64,0:51:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.24,0:51:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点古怪 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kinky. I like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.75,0:52:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.76,0:53:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 这屋子有点不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. There's something different about this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.57,0:53:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.38,0:54:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.32,0:54:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,文！姜 感谢老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wang! Chon, for God's sakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.29,0:54:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他出现了 我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he shows up. I found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.56,0:54:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你想听一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Do you want to hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.28,0:54:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉玺不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seal's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.14,0:54:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.91,0:54:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.85,0:54:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还回来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.08,0:54:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.43,0:55:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要那么做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must you keep doing that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.03,0:55:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能被看见或听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was taught not to be seen or heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.67,0:55:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉玺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.87,0:55:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个遵守诺言的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a man of my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.21,0:55:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得看我哥哥摆弄这个的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember watching my brother play with this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.01,0:55:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,象个婴儿喋喋不休\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a baby rattle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.38,0:55:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我想碰它的时候 太后就打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'd try to touch it, the dowager empress beat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.92,0:55:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,毋庸质疑 你有个可怜的童年\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt your deprived childhood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.02,0:55:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,使你变成今天这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}made you into the man you are today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.36,0:55:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌超\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wu Chow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.56,0:55:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wu who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.23,0:55:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是皇帝的私生子弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the emperor's bastard brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.60,0:55:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从紫禁城驱逐出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was banished from the Forbidden City{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.10,0:55:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为想偷玉玺\N{\fnArial\fs30}for trying to steal the lmperial Seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.00,0:55:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的爸爸抓住他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father caught him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.37,0:55:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发誓要回去继承王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}He vowed to return to claim the emperor's throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.41,0:55:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.21,0:55:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都在按计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll assume everything has been arranged as discussed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.85,0:56:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好担心的 一切进行得很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have nothing to worry about. It's all in place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.75,0:56:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个钻石有猴子爪那么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That diamond is as big as a damn monkey's paw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.92,0:56:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that. Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.52,0:56:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打它的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.22,0:56:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是羡慕那技术 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just admiring the craftsmanship, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.03,0:56:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止 我们的交易结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for now, our business is completed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.10,0:56:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Lin?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.69,0:56:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.79,0:56:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.86,0:56:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是替你保管一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just looking out for number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.36,0:56:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.93,0:56:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子拿了玉玺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid got the seal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.02,0:57:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.53,0:57:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.20,0:57:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.28,0:57:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! You can do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.45,0:57:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.89,0:57:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.02,0:57:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.53,0:57:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 我们俩认识那么久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, what in our history together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.03,0:57:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认为我能做到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes you think I'm capable of something like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.60,0:57:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy! I can't do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.20,0:57:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.17,0:58:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.24,0:58:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个更好的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a better way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.48,0:58:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.65,0:58:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要死啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a bat out of hell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.15,0:58:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶…喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeehaw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.95,0:58:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 我不知道刹车在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I don't know where the brake is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.39,0:58:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.09,0:58:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.85,0:58:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办 兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now, buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.55,0:58:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 放松 从这开始滑行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, relax. Smooth sailing from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.20,0:59:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是了 这两个人就是攻击我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, these are the men who attacked me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.43,0:59:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这些攻击者已经… 暂时开始躲避我们了 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid the assailants have temporarily eluded us, my Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.74,0:59:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你应该解释给我听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you could explain to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.74,0:59:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子玲是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}how Loony Lin managed to escape{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.88,0:59:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,从有全世界最值得尊敬警察看守的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the confines of Scotland Yard under the watch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.61,0:59:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦警察局越狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the most respected police force in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.12,0:59:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 的确 是很令人费解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course. It's absolutely fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.32,0:59:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用一副相当\N{\fnArial\fs30}She picked the lock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.49,0:59:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,淫秽的扑克牌撬开了锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}using a deck of rather risqué playing cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.96,0:59:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后利用一个拖把和一个叉子 还有各种各样偷盗用的紧身衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then scaled the walls with a mop, a fork….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.30,0:59:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬过了围墙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and various pilfered undergarments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.80,0:59:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要把她移交中国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to hand it to the Chinese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.53,0:59:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们非常蠢 大人 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're awfully ingenious, Lord, aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.44,0:59:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的无知知道什么！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your incompetence know no bounds?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.34,1:00:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.34,1:00:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.64,1:00:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不认识这些女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know these women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.01,1:00:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲 你在这干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.85,1:00:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 主啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.65,1:00:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想试试37页上的那毒药吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to try the position on page 37?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.56,1:00:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我的小荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you little minx.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.83,1:00:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.35,1:01:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？不 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? No, I'm not okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.35,1:01:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚被牧场的动物强暴过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just been violated by a barnyard animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.96,1:01:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会在这空地中央堆一堆石头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would leave a pile of stones in the middle of the field?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.49,1:01:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 姜 这些人很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Chon. These people are nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.20,1:01:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.00,1:01:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能告诉你些事吗？什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I tell you something? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.11,1:01:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一次该死的冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a hell of a damn adventure we're on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.51,1:01:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你在一起很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having an absolute ball with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.25,1:01:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.39,1:01:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.29,1:01:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的拇指伸出来 王公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your thumb out, maharaja.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.19,1:01:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？过这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Get over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.76,1:01:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.30,1:01:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲 玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin! Lin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.81,1:01:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肩膀有点紧绷绷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My shoulder's getting a little tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.48,1:02:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第一次来英国 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your first time in England, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.98,1:02:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这附近的路的？难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know your way around? It's incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.98,1:02:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向来方向感都很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always had a good sense of direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.48,1:02:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can say that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.42,1:02:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们能一起说你了解谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish we could say the same about you know who.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.82,1:02:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一但把他送到山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I once sent him over a mountain range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.59,1:02:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就永远迷路\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was lost forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.09,1:02:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次 我把他送到长城\N{\fnArial\fs30}One time, I sent him over the Great Wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.80,1:02:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他迷路迷了3天 3天？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was lost for three days. Three days?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.07,1:02:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 我们有这么多共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gosh, we got a lot in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.00,1:02:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没遇到象你这样的人 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never met anybody like you, Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.51,1:02:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？　　　是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.24,1:02:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 在你不高兴之前… 我能告诉你件事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I tell you something without you getting offended?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.21,1:02:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.58,1:02:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的身材很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a great body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.79,1:02:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说是因为从外表就可以看的出\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. I said it. It's out in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.06,1:02:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须解决 我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must work out. Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.73,1:02:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.96,1:02:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.63,1:03:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢坐在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the backseat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.03,1:03:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我感到恶心 眩晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me sick. Dizzy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.78,1:03:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,白色小教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whitechapel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.11,1:03:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看起来象是个好邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like a nice enough neighborhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.75,1:03:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猫和靴子是什么？是个寄宿公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Puss 'n' Boots? It's a boardinghouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.39,1:03:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些船上的水手极力推荐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the sailors on the ship coming over recommended it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.10,1:03:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.97,1:03:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让我妹妹住这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let my sister stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.78,1:03:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么办？到萨瓦去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do? Check in to the Savoy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.98,1:03:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在进房间前被拘捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get arrested before we get to our room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.88,1:03:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不介意这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.52,1:03:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 她还是有点开放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? She's a little openminded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.99,1:03:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很荒谬 因为我刚认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this sounds crazy 'cause I just met her….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.03,1:03:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我爱上她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think I'm falling for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.83,1:04:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她就是我要的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she's the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.16,1:04:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 他是我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, she's my baby sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.96,1:04:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她是 谢谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she is. Thank God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.10,1:04:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我得到的唯一机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only chance I've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.57,1:04:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经准备好了要开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting ready to launch a little thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.60,1:04:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做「行动：让她倒在我怀里」\N{\fnArial\fs30}called "Operation: Sweep Her Off Her Feet."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.44,1:04:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在她面前帮我说好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a position to talk me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.57,1:04:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能靠你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I count on you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.98,1:04:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我从没向你要求过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, buddy, I've never asked you for anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.11,1:04:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 罗伊 我会告诉她实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, Roy. I'll tell her the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.55,1:04:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把事实拖一拖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get hung up on the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.98,1:04:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你的老友修修毛边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to smooth out your old pal's rough edges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.62,1:04:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.43,1:04:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.90,1:04:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.93,1:05:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.29,1:05:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要过夜吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy a tumble?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.76,1:05:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 两天前你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Where were you two days ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.03,1:05:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能马上就会和你做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have bedded you in a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.30,1:05:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你在找一个已经改变了的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're looking at a changed man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.00,1:05:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以说为一个特殊的人保留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sort of saving myself for someone special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.07,1:05:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你打折\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a discount.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.08,1:05:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是所有女人对我说的最浪漫的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the most romantic thing any woman's ever said to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.58,1:05:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.85,1:05:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好在我们失控前离开这 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better go before we lose control. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.05,1:05:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你改变了主意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you change your mind….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.29,1:05:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.80,1:05:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的长辈会给你找适合你的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father would talk about the right man for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.20,1:05:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须要强壮、勇敢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be strong, courageous….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.24,1:05:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还要是个好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a good father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.87,1:05:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,象罗伊那样？　　　行了 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Roy. We got her, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.31,1:05:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是象罗伊那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.14,1:05:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不象我了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know him like I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.01,1:05:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有很多坏习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has many bad habits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.91,1:06:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such as?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.15,1:06:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽烟 喝酒 还有赌博\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drinks, smokes, and he gambles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.02,1:06:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 你这是在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, where are you going with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.69,1:06:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了钱而和女人睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sleeps with women for money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.69,1:06:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.02,1:06:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊不会那么做 我可看到他在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy don't do that. I can see inside him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.03,1:06:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心肠很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a good heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.50,1:06:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.66,1:06:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的三文鱼不逆流而游\N{\fnArial\fs30}His salmon don't swim upstream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.13,1:06:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对牛弹琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shoots blanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.84,1:06:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲 他不值得信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin, he cannot be trusted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.34,1:06:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能那么说？他是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you say that? You're his friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.91,1:06:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sort of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.45,1:06:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy is the type of a friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.95,1:06:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别把他介绍给你其他的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd never introduce to your other friends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.35,1:06:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者把他带回家见家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or bring home to your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.19,1:06:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来不说实话 你知道我管他叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never speak the truth. You know what I call him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.99,1:06:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是罗伊·欧班纳 罗伊·欧胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Roy O'Bannon. Roy O'Baloney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.43,1:06:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.16,1:06:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲 我不许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin, I forbid it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.33,1:06:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.61,1:07:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 你在这啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, there you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.28,1:07:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨　　　嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Mmhmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.88,1:07:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么 兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need anything, buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.05,1:07:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一大堆「别烦我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole lot of "leave me alone."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.72,1:07:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.39,1:07:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.39,1:07:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从床的另一边醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up on the wrong side of the bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.40,1:07:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得后背有点疼 好像有人在那扎了一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel a little pain in my back like someone put a knife there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.63,1:07:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.47,1:07:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用替我担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.61,1:07:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.62,1:07:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哒哒\N{\fnArial\fs30}T ada!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.52,1:07:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那实际上让我想起了一个诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}That actually reminds me of a trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.86,1:07:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没见过这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever seen this one?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.93,1:07:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or this one?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.09,1:07:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你的功夫很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're so cool with your karate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.83,1:07:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你那象小孩似的反映\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your childlike reflexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.90,1:08:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.94,1:08:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.11,1:08:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的叫我罗伊·欧胡扯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really call me Roy Baloney?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.25,1:08:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.91,1:08:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚砸碎了我的难题箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just smashed my puzzle box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.82,1:08:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会知道我的消息是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never figure out my message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.99,1:08:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊…　　　走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy…. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.86,1:08:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你已经没有任何感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.73,1:08:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识姜文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know a Chon Wang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.11,1:08:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.21,1:08:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.51,1:08:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁爱你 宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who loves you, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.35,1:08:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错 姜　　　罗伊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, Chon. Roy….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.08,1:08:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.96,1:08:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再那么做一次 你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that again, and you're a dead man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.57,1:09:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,枕头战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pillow fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.33,1:09:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罗伊·欧胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Roy Baloney!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.04,1:09:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.10,1:09:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm full of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.17,1:09:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.87,1:10:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.57,1:10:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.34,1:10:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.21,1:10:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was his idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.38,1:10:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon! Clothes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.35,1:11:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是散步的好天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice night for a walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.79,1:11:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.83,1:11:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲 你在这啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin! There you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.36,1:11:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.43,1:11:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道这有很多连环杀手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know there's a serial killer on the loose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.17,1:11:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别提了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.88,1:11:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are these guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.81,1:11:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boxers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.81,1:11:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想从我们这得到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they want with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.31,1:11:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.05,1:11:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们应该谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we need to have a little chat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.90,1:11:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon Wang{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.10,1:11:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以与皇帝对抗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man who can fight an emperor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.94,1:11:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个皇帝从来不应该有… 他自己的葬礼刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor should never have his burial knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.71,1:12:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.37,1:12:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然是我哥哥的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still my brother's lapdog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.91,1:12:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这不是为了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here not for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.65,1:12:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这为了我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.72,1:12:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.72,1:12:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我用匕首插进他的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my dagger that plunged into his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.36,1:12:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,沾了他的血 匕首也锈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still crusted with his blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.20,1:12:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道玉玺在那小孩身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the boy has the seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.63,1:12:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.87,1:12:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.04,1:12:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是事实我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the truth we don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.00,1:12:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.84,1:12:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要… 你要干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.21,1:12:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 把她放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Put her down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.92,1:12:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她放下来 把她放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her down! Put her down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.52,1:12:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然怎么样 欧班纳先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what, Mr. O'Bannon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.35,1:12:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要踢我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna kick my ass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.79,1:12:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了你所有的自编的荒谬的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read all about your ridiculous exploits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.13,1:12:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, just….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.63,1:12:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赤手空拳杀死木乃伊的感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how does it feel to kill a mummy with your bare hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.00,1:12:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有那些无知的乡下人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a nation of uneducated rednecks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.20,1:13:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会对这种西部牛仔的鬼话赶兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be amused by such cowboy drivel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.94,1:13:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 噢 噢 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.07,1:13:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么要对我人身攻击？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the personal attacks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.41,1:13:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看我的注解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't see me making any comments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.18,1:13:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你苍白的面色 还有你那下贱的口音\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your pasty complexion or your snotty accent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.65,1:13:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的污秽发霉的色情小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even your filthy, smutty sex books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.75,1:13:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我看了你的书 令我作呕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I saw your book. It disgusted me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.35,1:13:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你的人为什么老是打头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, why is it always the head with you people?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.46,1:13:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 停下 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it! Stop! Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.23,1:13:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.39,1:13:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这干什么？看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing here? Guys, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.40,1:13:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,象野兽一样…要怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're acting like animals…. over what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.13,1:13:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要玉玺？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some seal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.44,1:13:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉玺代表了皇帝的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seal represents imperial power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.74,1:13:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用他来联合皇帝的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will use it to unite the emperor's enemies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.54,1:13:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,围攻紫禁城\N{\fnArial\fs30}and storm the Forbidden City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.58,1:13:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in it for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.08,1:13:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到的是未来的英国国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at the future king of England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.38,1:13:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你排在继承君主宝座的第20位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're, like, 20th in line to the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.35,1:13:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,第10位\N{\fnArial\fs30}10th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.68,1:13:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我的朋友马上就要把这改写\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my friend is about to change all that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.89,1:13:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单的…消灭过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}by simple…. process of elimination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.43,1:14:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个叫机关枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a machine gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.56,1:14:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟可以射出200发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first of its kind it fires 200 rounds a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.93,1:14:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大不列颠的遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Testament to British ingenuity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.30,1:14:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是你偷了玉玺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so you steal the seal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.21,1:14:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再杀9个皇室成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you knock off nine royals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.04,1:14:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得到的好处不多 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the short end of that stick, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.65,1:14:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们扔到河里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dump them in the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.05,1:14:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要把她带到哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you taking her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.55,1:14:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去创造历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.49,1:14:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经能看到头条新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can already see the headlines{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.76,1:14:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「全国为疯子玲残杀皇室默哀」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Nation mourns as Loony Lin massacres royal family."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.88,1:14:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你确保你能找到玉玺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your assurance that you will find the seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.31,1:14:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要涉及到你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't concern yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.05,1:14:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人在城里搜\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men are scouring the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.15,1:15:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好祈祷他们能找到… 不然我们的合作就会终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better pray they find it…. or our agreement is over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.22,1:15:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也永远得不到皇冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will never get the crown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.27,1:15:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 我有点事要向你坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, I got a confession to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.17,1:15:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱上我妹妹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in love with my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.44,1:15:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that, but….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.51,1:15:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在那个股票上输掉所有的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't lose all the money on the zeppelins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.31,1:15:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.78,1:15:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我用了大部份的钱出版我的小说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. I blew most of it on the Roy O'Bannon novels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.15,1:15:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.72,1:15:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 塞奇麦考利斯特写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sage McCallister wrote them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.35,1:15:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是我要说的 兄弟 我就是塞奇·麦考利斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm saying, buddy. I'm Sage McCallister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.53,1:15:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你写的那些谎话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wrote those lies?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.13,1:15:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都很自卑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always had low selfesteem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.10,1:15:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你印了多少本？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many books did you print?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.63,1:15:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我私人出版大概100万份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I selfpublished probably a million copies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.87,1:15:50.84,Title,0,0,0,0,,那年我们只比《圣经》少了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were actually second to the Bible that year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.90,1:15:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.84,1:15:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我是能找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm just about the worst friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.04,1:15:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,最坏的朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a guy could ask for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.58,1:16:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是我的好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're a good friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.98,1:16:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.15,1:16:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真爱玲 我不会再阻止你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really love Lin, I won't stand in the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.62,1:16:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.79,1:16:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果你伤了她的心… 我会打断你的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you break her heart…. I'll break your legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.06,1:16:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.46,1:16:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远的朋友 姜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, friends to the end, Chon….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.03,1:16:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,时辰到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.44,1:16:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 有什么计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, you got a plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.91,1:16:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是这么巧有个计划吧 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't happen to have a plan, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.47,1:16:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.57,1:16:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做什么？　　　没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I can do? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.44,1:16:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我会让你举重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I'll let you do the heavy lifting, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.19,1:16:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.67,1:16:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.70,1:16:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 姜 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon! Chon, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.87,1:16:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.04,1:16:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 姜 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Chon, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.84,1:17:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.78,1:17:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.95,1:17:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.22,1:17:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.62,1:17:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,水真脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water's so dirty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.19,1:17:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 水很脏 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! It's dirty! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.08,1:17:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走吧 淹死我吧 我不在乎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go ahead and drown me. I don't care anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.26,1:17:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.52,1:18:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.16,1:18:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们看起来还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.99,1:19:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的必须要阻止这件事的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really must protest this intrusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.13,1:19:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦的所有人都在搜查街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every bobby in London is out scouring the streets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.33,1:19:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.33,1:19:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝酒了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been drinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.80,1:19:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失业的时候总是喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always drink when my employment's been terminated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.24,1:19:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们解雇你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fired you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.37,1:19:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷斯本大人这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Rathbone saw to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.37,1:19:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.44,1:19:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不合逻辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's of no consequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.01,1:19:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想过在一线上当探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted to be an inspector in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.45,1:19:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我爸爸的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my father's idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.95,1:19:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想当作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wanted to be a writer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.25,1:19:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.42,1:19:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蒂 我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artie, we need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.26,1:19:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷斯本抓了玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rathbone has taken Lin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.89,1:19:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去杀皇室成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill the royal family{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.43,1:19:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要篡夺皇位\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's gonna assume the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.93,1:19:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any evidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.46,1:19:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来支持这些无聊的断言？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to support these preposterous allegations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.57,1:19:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有这个 那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have this. It's the boy's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.30,1:19:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的技巧 告诉我们他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your technique. Tell us where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.11,1:19:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,石蜡 很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paraffin wax most interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.58,1:19:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's at a church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.08,1:19:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小鬼藏在教堂里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little punk's hiding in a church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.95,1:19:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.55,1:19:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是烛蜡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not candle wax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.55,1:19:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.49,1:20:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 你会找到它的 你们在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. You'll get it. What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.32,1:20:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在撬锁　　　那好 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's picking the lock. Well, hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.33,1:20:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 拜托 拜托 这是一个要非常小心翼翼的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, please! Please. It's a very meticulous process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.66,1:20:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让阿蒂做他的工作 这几乎就是艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Artie do his job. It's almost an art form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.17,1:20:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要有外科医生的精确度\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes the precision of a surgeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.37,1:20:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要很精确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be so precise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.67,1:20:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我们把那边的那个堵上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if we jam another one in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.44,1:20:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That works, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.08,1:20:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺少一个可靠的策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lacks a certain finesse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.85,1:20:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 让我们把它分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. Let's split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.69,1:21:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.03,1:21:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拧断你的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gonna break your neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.06,1:21:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.97,1:22:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looky here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.97,1:22:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 在哪呢？　　　什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, where is it? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.17,1:22:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.88,1:22:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再听见「什么」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me that "what."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.01,1:22:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.38,1:22:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.18,1:22:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意我把这个拿回去吧 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mind if I take this back, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.55,1:22:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续 滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.19,1:22:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.19,1:22:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.22,1:22:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.53,1:22:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把玉玺给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.13,1:22:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把玉玺给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the seal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.88,1:23:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 打开看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, spread out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.31,1:23:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.75,1:23:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.32,1:23:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,被包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gig's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.67,1:23:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.51,1:23:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, think!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.88,1:23:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是英国罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to an English prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.21,1:23:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一头金发 姜的运动造形\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my feathery blond hair and Chon's athletic build, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.15,1:23:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定会被玩爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll try to make us the belle of the ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.15,1:23:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 我不要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. I'm not going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.55,1:23:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少 我们有个好地方看烟花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least we'll get a good view of the fireworks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.82,1:23:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.19,1:23:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟花？　　　是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fireworks? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.09,1:24:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜 他们会用一个小型舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}At midnight, they're launching this huge display{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.63,1:24:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在泰晤士河放\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a flotilla of barges on the Thames.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.46,1:24:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是女皇50年庆典的开幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the official kickoff to the Queen's Jubilee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.43,1:24:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇室也会去那吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the royal family gonna be there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.07,1:24:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会在展览馆的阳台看\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be viewing the spectacle from a balcony{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.91,1:24:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以看到整条河\N{\fnArial\fs30}overlooking the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.47,1:24:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在游艇上装了机关枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a machine gun on the barge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.31,1:24:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.32,1:24:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gents lost your way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.36,1:24:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 告诉我你有办法出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, tell me you got a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.00,1:24:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 干的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice move, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.21,1:24:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么回来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did you come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.67,1:24:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么放弃玉玺？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you give up the seal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.98,1:24:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.35,1:24:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我也是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm a fool, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.08,1:25:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把她给我吧 傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, put her there, fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.42,1:25:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没记住你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never got your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.66,1:25:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Chaplin….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.86,1:25:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理·卓别林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie Chaplin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.39,1:26:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.96,1:26:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你 劳驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.12,1:26:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.30,1:26:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去通知皇室\N{\fnArial\fs30}You warn the royal family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.94,1:26:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去救玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll save Lin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.04,1:26:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟怎么能做到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How on earth are you gonna do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.33,1:27:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.77,1:28:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just saved you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.13,1:28:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.30,1:28:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.01,1:28:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳尔逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nelson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.26,1:28:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要藏在后面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you hiding yourself back there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.12,1:28:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能阻挡你看烟花 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't like to impede your view, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.43,1:28:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话 你安排了这所有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense. You arranged all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.36,1:28:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该到前排看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have a frontrow view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.30,1:28:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾…出于尊敬 我不能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret that, uh, respectfully I must decline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.90,1:28:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好盯着进程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to keep a good eye on proceedings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.77,1:28:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.31,1:28:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳尔逊 你已经超越了你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nelson, you've outdone yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.78,1:28:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着看大结局吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till you see the finale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.65,1:28:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.62,1:28:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.09,1:29:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.66,1:30:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hopeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.00,1:30:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有办法绕过卫兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna get past the guards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.00,1:30:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直有那种想法我们就不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not with that attitude we won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.67,1:30:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 阿蒂 一定有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Artie. There's got to be a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.63,1:30:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.02,1:30:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,玲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.35,1:31:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeehaw! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.69,1:31:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶…驾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeehaw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.46,1:31:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶…驾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeehaw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.99,1:31:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要跳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to jump it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.68,1:32:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌超\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wu Chow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.33,1:32:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在那别动 雷斯本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there, Rathboner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.10,1:32:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你要匆忙撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing by your hasty retreat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.67,1:32:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你还是排在第20位\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're still 20th in line for the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.17,1:32:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,第10位\N{\fnArial\fs30}10th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.48,1:32:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯南道尔侦探 把这个人抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector Doyle, arrest this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.52,1:32:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.58,1:32:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.45,1:32:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.69,1:32:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.86,1:32:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.19,1:32:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷斯本用把女人用的枪打伤了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rathbone nailed Artie with a little sissy gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.66,1:32:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照顾他 你们俩继续追\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll look after him. You two go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.06,1:32:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.24,1:33:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.31,1:33:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.28,1:33:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了老人家 文\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Old Man Wang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.32,1:33:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的幸运扑克牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my lucky playing cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.39,1:33:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.63,1:33:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉雷斯本小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Rathbone to be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.53,1:33:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.34,1:33:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要把大点的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need a bigger gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.39,1:34:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.83,1:34:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.30,1:34:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来吧 雷斯本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show your face, Rathbone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.27,1:34:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把这个家伙碎尸万段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tear this guy apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.77,1:34:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 你走这边 我走那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, you go this way. I'll go that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.24,1:34:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,分开？我不知道是不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split up? I don't know if that's a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.97,1:34:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.48,1:34:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.99,1:34:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.33,1:34:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 快点罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, come on, Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.34,1:34:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 雷斯本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, Rathbone….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.68,1:34:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在想个好书名给我的新书…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just thinking of a title for my new book….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.01,1:34:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,「罗伊·欧班纳对决娘娘腔君主」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Roy O'Bannon vs. Little Lord Sissy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.82,1:35:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫「罗伊·欧班纳对决… 想当女皇的男人」怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about "Roy O'Bannon vs. The Man Who Would Be Queen"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.79,1:35:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见他的影子 姜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of him, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.12,1:35:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,海岸已经查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coast is clear up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.00,1:35:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy! Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.07,1:35:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.20,1:35:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.54,1:35:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.98,1:35:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你看看你爸爸是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you how your father died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.29,1:36:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.46,1:36:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我知道你在那 爱我 恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me know you're there. Love me. Hate me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.12,1:36:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是让我知道 你就在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let me know you're up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.46,1:36:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 从这可以看到我们住的宾馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I can see our hotel from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.80,1:36:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.81,1:36:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.65,1:36:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.45,1:36:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 罗伊 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Roy. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.75,1:36:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊·欧班纳不会平平静静的离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy O'Bannon will not go quietly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.92,1:36:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了？英格兰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that, England?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.32,1:36:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想从我这得到什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw whatever you want at me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.16,1:36:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕的天气 你们这些杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}your terrible weather, your perverted killers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.16,1:36:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,葡萄干布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}your Spotted Dick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.00,1:37:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 你快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, you're about to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.67,1:37:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在分针上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on the minute hand of a clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.20,1:37:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命在我眼前闪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life is flashing before my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.81,1:37:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我不记得她了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I don't remember her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.99,1:37:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.61,1:38:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.86,1:38:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.94,1:38:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}How disappointing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.64,1:38:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.99,1:38:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.40,1:39:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.72,1:39:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.89,1:39:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你死了　　　哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead! Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.39,1:39:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为那些喝茶的精神病…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think some teadrinking psycho{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.96,1:39:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,能杀我罗伊·欧班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}can take out Roy O'Bannon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.47,1:39:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.64,1:39:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 牛仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy there, cowboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.91,1:39:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.96,1:40:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any ideas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.60,1:40:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.57,1:40:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跳 跳？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We jump! Jump?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.24,1:40:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说掉下去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean fall?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.68,1:40:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准那面旗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim for the flag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.51,1:40:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.41,1:40:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.18,1:40:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.35,1:40:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我交的最好的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best sidekick I could ever ask for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.32,1:40:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 罗伊 我也是这么想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Roy. I feel the same about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.82,1:40:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到3\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.16,1:40:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,1…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.39,1:40:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,2…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.83,1:40:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,3　3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three! Three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.49,1:41:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy. Roy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.49,1:41:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.13,1:41:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于突出的胆色的赏识\N{\fnArial\fs30}In recognition of outstanding bravery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.84,1:41:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我授于姜文爵士称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dub you Sir Chon Wang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.51,1:41:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于不凡的英勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}For uncommon valor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.51,1:41:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我授于罗伊·欧班纳爵士称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dub you Sir Roy O'Bannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.36,1:41:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于正义的坚定贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for steadfast dedication to justice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.19,1:41:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我授于柯南·道尔爵士称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dub you Sir Arthur Conan Doyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.70,1:41:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.32,1:42:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁爱你 宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who loves you, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.57,1:42:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.27,1:42:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蒂 我打赌伦敦警察局 现在肯定非常渴望你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artie, I bet Scotland Yard's dying to get you back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.28,1:42:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打击犯罪的日子已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My official crimefighting days are over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.55,1:42:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,女皇要求我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen has asked me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.75,1:42:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,护送玉玺回中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}to accompany the lmperial Seal back to China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.12,1:42:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一周啊 难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a week. Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.62,1:42:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有更好人选了 对吗 姜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She couldn't have picked a better man, right, Chon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.62,1:42:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.75,1:42:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,航程中我就有时间写我的新小说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the voyage is gonna give me time to work on my new novel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.82,1:42:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他展示了一个新的侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}It features a new kind of detective, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.13,1:42:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将用推理学来解决一切犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's gonna solve crimes using deductive reasoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.20,1:42:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我个名字 他叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a name. What's his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.80,1:43:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 罗伊 我很希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, Roy, I was rather hoping{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.40,1:43:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他谢洛克·豪穆斯 如果你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}to call him Sherlock Holmes, if that's all right with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.07,1:43:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不用就侮辱我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be insulted if you didn't use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.41,1:43:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哒 再见 阿蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta. See you, Artie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.32,1:43:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 你表现的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was very nice of you, Roy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.72,1:43:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它好的话我会自己留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've kept the name if I thought it was any good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.09,1:43:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对侦探来说那是个恐怖的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a horrible name for a detective{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.76,1:43:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢洛克·豪穆斯 豪穆斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.53,1:43:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能不再玩那个？我要把它捏碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stop playing with that? I'm gonna smash it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.43,1:43:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想看一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to see it for a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.73,1:43:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我看看吧 不行 你会把它打烂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me see it. No, you're gonna break it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.43,1:43:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只不过是块石头 上面有点字罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a rock with some gibberish on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.94,1:43:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是汉语\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Chinese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.31,1:43:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,家是永远的 我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Family is forever, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.44,1:43:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你自己扔的石头而自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud you cast your own stone."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.51,1:43:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.68,1:43:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.26,1:43:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想扔块我自己的石头 姜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to cast my own stone, Chon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.17,1:44:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨　嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.24,1:44:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 欧班纳式的房子一定成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you the house of O'Bannon will prevail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.28,1:44:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜 我有个生意建议给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon, I got a business proposition for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.12,1:44:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再买飞艇股票了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more zeppelins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.45,1:44:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 这个比飞艇好得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, this is much better than zeppelins{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.32,1:44:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在加州的一个新兴事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}a new thing they're starting out in California{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.22,1:44:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫它会动的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}called moving pictures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.72,1:44:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,免谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.79,1:44:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 慢点 听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it. Hold it. Hear me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.43,1:44:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的认为电影可以发挥你的强项\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really think these movies could play to your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.86,1:44:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sound, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.86,1:44:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们不需要担心语言问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we don't have to worry about the language problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.03,1:44:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我认为 功夫片的潜力很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think the kung fu stuff could be huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.87,1:44:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们渴望看到动作片\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dying for a good action picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.11,1:44:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.77,1:44:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜文 电影明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chon Wang, movie star?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.78,1:44:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有干头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.28,1:44:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得… 开发那个卓别林小孩不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel bad about ditching that Chaplin kid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.61,1:44:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我要在好莱坞开间片厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're gonna be running and gunning in Hollywood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.08,1:45:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是紧跟我的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he'd just cramp our style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.55,1:45:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,困难的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's such a tough town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.77,1:45:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「野蛮的观光客」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody tourists!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.37,1:45:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Action!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.93,1:45:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要说「卡」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to say "cut."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.59,1:45:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在那看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just keep looking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.97,1:45:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 你这小荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you little minx.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.64,1:45:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.94,1:45:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.48,1:45:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的不错 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a good one, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.55,1:46:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我应该舔你 你说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe on this one I should lick you….you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.22,1:46:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你舔完我之后 应该不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, after you lick me that could be kind of good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.35,1:46:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 杰克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Jackie….{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.22,1:46:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.42,1:46:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 嗨 欧文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Hi, Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.36,1:46:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.56,1:46:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我不是罗伊·欧班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and I'm not Roy O'Bannon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.06,1:46:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.86,1:46:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 姜 我知道她才是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Chon, I think she's the one.{\r}
